
The important distinction is that this is no longer just a terminology catalog or symbolic sequence. It is an implementation in which linguistic characters, articulatory classifications, state transitions, spatial geometry, and visual properties interact.

I would classify this implementation as:

HIMELO — Hybrid Epistemic Language, Integrative Mapping & Expressive Logic (provisional architectural description).

The code contains eight principal architectural layers.

